AnimJson←{
   ⍝ Planet data ⍵ (from AnimFrames) as members of a JSON object:
   ⍝ for each field, an array per body of its values in each frame
    fjs←{'¯'⎕R'-'⊢⍕⍵} ⋄ fj←{1↓∊',',¨fjs¨⍵}
    field←{'"',⍺,'":[',(1↓∊',',¨{'[',(fj ⍵),']'}¨↓⍉⍵),'],'}
    names←'px' 'py' 'vis' 'rah' 'ram' 'dec' 'alt' 'az' 'mx' 'my'
    (∊names field¨10↑⍵),'"phase":[',(fj 11⊃⍵),']' }
